          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.2.18+MRK.2.19+MRK.2.20+MRK.2.21+MRK.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 2:18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.33+LUK.5.34+LUK.5.35+LUK.5.36+LUK.5.37+LUK.5.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:33-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi akaizirwa abeegi ba Yohaana, baamubuuza bati: Ahabw'enki itwe n'Abafarisaayo kaingi twesiibyakwo, haza abeegi baawe bo bateesiibyakwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 3:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Abakwe nibabaasa bata kuganya bakiine kishwera? Obunaku buryahika, obu kishwera aribaihwaho; obwo nibwo baryesiibyakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tihariho muntu oteera ekiremu ky'omwenda musya aha mwenda omukuru; ahabw'okuba ekyo ekyabaziirwaho kikaataagura ekijwaro, n'ekifumuka kihanguha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi tibashuka viinyo y'omutahe omu furebe z'empu ezikuzire; ku baakukora batyo, efurebe zikaabaruka, viinyo eyatika, n'efurebe zikaabaruka, viinyo eyatika, n'efurebe zisiisikara. Kureka viinyo y'omutahe eshukwa omu furebe ensya, byona bibona kurama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
